  {
   "id": "the-knight-witch-201483@1.8",
   "gameId": "the-knight-witch-201483",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.8",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-12-22T11:00:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Calling all Knight Witches!✨",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our first patch is now live on Steam! Thank you for your patience and feedback over the last few weeks, as we've worked to resolve some post-launch bugs and issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "➕ Added",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "16:10 aspect ratio support.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Achievements checker at the start of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🐛 Bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hooded Skull NPC fix where dialogue and pause menu could cause issues with each other.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quit to Desktop feature now working as intended.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix on all bosses that prevents block if boss and player die at the same time (also fix on corrupted saves with this problem).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed so two Lalashi's can spawn after defeating the boss in the Giga Tree.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Missing Shadow on Stump whilst hovering fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added collision for the pond in the seed room from Catacombs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚖️ Balance changes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prologue and Mirror Lake balance changes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's all for now, but keep an eye on our Steam page and social media channels as we continue to update the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have any extra feedback, both positive and negative, we'd love to hear it! Make a post in the game's General Discussions and we'll be able to find it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "✨Keep up-to-date with The Knight Witch✨",
